        "title": "Proteolytic processing of neuropeptide Y and peptide YY by dipeptidyl peptidase IV.",
        "authorString": "Mentlein R, Dahms P, Grandt D, Krüger R.",
        "authorList": {
          "author": [
            {
              "fullName": "Mentlein R",
